    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the structure before improving understandability.Now I have a clear picture. The original test has a single `@Test` method but carries a lot of unused imports and unused `data_*` helper methods (those belong to the full test suite). I'll produce a clean, focused version that:\n- Removes all unused imports and dead data methods\n- Keeps only what the single test needs\n- Adds a brief clarifying comment to explain the intentThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored file removes all unused imports and dead `data_*` helper methods, retains only the imports and fields needed by the single `@Test` method, and adds brief comments explaining the chronology configuration and why `MINUTE_OF_DAY` must trigger `UnsupportedTemporalTypeException`."
    }
